NOTICE

This object set is an HFX compilation of the Global River Topology (GRIT)
vector datasets and selected raster datasets, hosted at grit/hfx-v0.3.0/ on
basin-delineations-public.upstream.tech.

Vector source data: Global River Topology (GRIT) vector datasets,
Wortmann et al. 2025, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.17435232
(https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17435232), Zenodo record 17435232.

Raster source data: Global River Topology (GRIT) raster datasets,
Wortmann et al. 2025, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.15715535
(https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15715535), Zenodo record 15715535. This HFX
compilation uses the drainage_direction rasters and the width-partitioned
drainage_area rasters.

Related paper: Wortmann, M. et al. (2025), “Global River Topology (GRIT): A
Bifurcating River Hydrography”, Water Resources Research, 61,
e2024WR038308, doi:10.1029/2024WR038308
(https://doi.org/10.1029/2024WR038308).

